  "reasoning": "The defendant Zhang, together with his wife, gave birth to premature twins. After the infants were rescued, Zhang demanded the hospital stop treatment and handed the babies to a taxi driver to be abandoned. This conduct constitutes the criminal act of abandoning a minor, which is defined under Chinese law as the crime of '遗弃罪' (abandonment). No other criminal conduct such as homicide, kidnapping, or abuse is indicated. Therefore the appropriate charge is abandonment.",
